What is FPD?
------------

FPD is a door to MAXsBBS (Anthony Barrett) which makes it possible to use
FilePather (Johan Torin) on new files.

For more information on MAXsBBS and FilePather - read THEIR docs!


How to install?
---------------

It's VERY easy - if you follow these instructions:

1. Make sure that MAXsBBS(at least v 1.40) and FilePather is installed.
2. Copy FPD to your door-directory (BBS:Doors/) 

    CLI:

    Copy FPD to BBS:Doors/

3. Change in you BBS-menus (config->menus):

  Everywhere you use function <23> (upload) you MUST change it to 34(door)
  and the 'Filename/Name/Dest/Path'-gadget to:
  BBS:Doors/FPD <section to upload to>



   Key:   Function:   Extra:   Lo Acc:   Hi acc:   Filename/name/dest/path:

    U       23          XX        YY       ZZ      <empty>

    |                    |        |         |
    |                    l_______ | _______ | ____________________
    |                             |         |                    |
   \|/                           \|/       \|/                  \|/

    U       34          0         YY       ZZ      BBS:Doors/FPD XX



4. READY!!!!


